  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/252) by Othmar Marti (Bitbucket: [Othmar Marti](https://bitbucket.org/Othmar Marti), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nWhen opening .RW2 raw files in ART 1.14 on Windows 11 it complains that ist is not able to write to the files  because they do not exist.\n\nI uninstalled ART 1.14, cleaned the directory and reinstalled it. Noch change, the issue stayed.\n\nI uninstalled ART 1.14, cleaned the directory and installed ART 1.13. Everything works, no complaint about not being able to write the sidecar files.\n",
